  partName: Front Mounting Clip
  description: The Front Mounting Clip is a tiny, elongated clip positioned at the
    middle-center-front of the engine, responsible for securing various components
    such as hoses, wires, or brackets. Its small size and elongated shape enable
    it to fit into tight spaces, allowing for efficient mounting and organization
    of engine components. Notably, the clip's material composition, Material.001,
    provides excellent flexibility and durability, making it an ideal choice for
    this application.
